      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "To achieve a microarray universal to any SNP, we proposed a new way to construct a genotyping-microarray by ligating a universal fluorescence-probe with SNP-encoded flaps cleaved from invasive reactions on a slide surface. Our proposed microarray is labor-saving and cost-saving in setting up a new experiment for genotyping multiple SNPs, which is related to personalized medicine."},
